# LF in the repository whatever the checkout platform does locally. Without this a Windows clone
# commits CRLF into the shell scripts and Dockerfiles, and the images stop building.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touched: the dataset is the committed artefact the seeder reads, and normalising bytes
# inside a gzip stream corrupts it.
*.gz binary
*.onnx binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
